window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/resources/security-v27-043-6bec68d26060fa7c.json"]={sha256:"6bec68d26060fa7c344342161b622ae58ec34faf5005572fc065bb2cf69a3f32",value:{"sources":[{"id":"v27-case-8ad45db3bbbd97b8","url":"https://www.gnu.org/software/mes/manual/mes.html","title":"GNU Mes manual: bootstrap seed and Guix bootstrap process","titleEn":"GNU Mes manual: bootstrap seed and Guix bootstrap process","publisher":"GNU Mes / Free Software Foundation","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"media":{"courses":[{"courseId":"security-v27-043","videos":[],"guides":[]}]},"related":{"courses":[{"courseId":"security-v27-043","related":[{"id":"security-v27-044","referenceUrls":["https://pip.pypa.io/en/stable/topics/secure-installs/"],"title":"pip：完整相依雜湊鎖定與平台wheel選取","titleEn":"pip: complete dependency hashes and platform-wheel selection","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：41.667%與25%由圖集合確認，剩餘3節點明列；沒有聲稱Guix所有平台皆無二進位前提。 交付bootstrap-closure.json、未審查種子清單與漏驅動器反例；本課不建置完整作業系統。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Confirm approximately 41.667 and 25 percent from graph sets and list the three remaining nodes, making no claim that all Guix platforms eliminate every binary prerequisite. Deliver bootstrap-closure.json, the unreviewed-seed inventory and missing-driver counterexample. The exercise models the chain without building an entire operating system.","difference":"建立12個本地套件需求描述，列精確版本、平台標籤、核准wheel摘要及遞移邊；使用假檔案做雜湊核對，不安裝未知套件。","differenceEn":"Build 12 local requirement descriptors with exact versions, platform tags, approved wheel digests and dependency edges. Use inert files for hash checks and never install unknown packages merely to demonstrate dependency resolution.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["本課計算仍依賴未審查種子的節點數，去重後取相依閉包；節點數不是位元組大小或風險機率，歷史Guix種子縮減數字不混入合成資料。 12個節點中有5個依賴未審查種子，其他7個在本課已審查閉包內；固定平台為教學模型，不宣稱對所有CPU架構適用。 未審查相依比例5/12×100≈41.667%；重建並審查一條種子路徑，使其中2個節點脫離未審查集合後為3/12×100=25%。","本課完整度要求每個實際選中產物都有預先核准雜湊；平台不同可能需多個合法wheel摘要，不能直接把下載當下算出的雜湊視為獨立批准。 12個選中需求中9個有精確版本與核准摘要，3個遞移需求缺雜湊；缺漏者分開列出，不能以no-deps隱藏。 完整度9/12×100=75%；補齊兩個遞移需求的已審查摘要後為11/12×100≈91.667%，仍不足整體安裝驗收。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["Count nodes still depending on an unreviewed seed after deduplicating the dependency closure. Node count is neither byte size nor compromise probability; do not mix historical Guix reduction figures into this synthetic graph. Five of 12 nodes depend on an unreviewed seed and seven lie within the reviewed classroom closure. Fix the teaching platform and avoid implying that identical bootstrap paths apply to every CPU architecture or operating system. Unreviewed dependency fraction is 5/12×100, approximately 41.667 percent. Rebuilding and reviewing one seed path removes two nodes from that set, leaving 3/12×100=25 percent.","Completeness requires a previously approved hash for every selected artifact. Different platforms may need multiple legitimate wheel hashes, but computing a hash immediately after an unreviewed download does not independently authorize its contents. Nine of 12 selected requirements have exact versions and approved hashes, while three transitive requirements lack hashes. List them explicitly instead of hiding the incomplete graph with a no-deps option or an already populated environment. Completeness is 9/12×100=75 percent. Adding reviewed hashes for two transitive requirements gives 11/12×100, approximately 91.667 percent, still insufficient for accepting the entire installation set.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]},{"id":"security-v27-053","referenceUrls":["https://github.com/ocsf/ocsf-schema"],"title":"OCSF：未知值、欄位映射與語意完整度","titleEn":"OCSF: unknown values, field mappings and semantic completeness","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：41.667%與25%由圖集合確認，剩餘3節點明列；沒有聲稱Guix所有平台皆無二進位前提。 交付bootstrap-closure.json、未審查種子清單與漏驅動器反例；本課不建置完整作業系統。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Confirm approximately 41.667 and 25 percent from graph sets and list the three remaining nodes, making no claim that all Guix platforms eliminate every binary prerequisite. Deliver bootstrap-closure.json, the unreviewed-seed inventory and missing-driver counterexample. The exercise models the chain without building an entire operating system.","difference":"建立來源欄位到目標欄位的對照，標明原值、映射值、未知原因與schema版本，不將未知結果映成成功。","differenceEn":"Map source to destination fields with original value, mapped value, unknown reason and schema version; never map unknown outcomes to success.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["本課計算仍依賴未審查種子的節點數，去重後取相依閉包；節點數不是位元組大小或風險機率，歷史Guix種子縮減數字不混入合成資料。 12個節點中有5個依賴未審查種子，其他7個在本課已審查閉包內；固定平台為教學模型，不宣稱對所有CPU架構適用。 未審查相依比例5/12×100≈41.667%；重建並審查一條種子路徑，使其中2個節點脫離未審查集合後為3/12×100=25%。","教學語意完整度以已知且正確映射的欄位槽位計算，並非OCSF官方分數或schema合法率。 本課所有數值、事件與系統狀態均為原創合成資料；只在本機檔案與授權隔離練習中處理，不接觸生產設備或他人資料。 100筆合成事件，每筆追蹤5個語意欄位，共500槽位；有20槽位無法確認來源值。 已知完整度=(500−20)/500=96%；未知槽位必須保留可查原因。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["Count nodes still depending on an unreviewed seed after deduplicating the dependency closure. Node count is neither byte size nor compromise probability; do not mix historical Guix reduction figures into this synthetic graph. Five of 12 nodes depend on an unreviewed seed and seven lie within the reviewed classroom closure. Fix the teaching platform and avoid implying that identical bootstrap paths apply to every CPU architecture or operating system. Unreviewed dependency fraction is 5/12×100, approximately 41.667 percent. Rebuilding and reviewing one seed path removes two nodes from that set, leaving 3/12×100=25 percent.","Teaching semantic completeness counts known correctly mapped slots; it is neither an official OCSF score nor schema validity. Every quantity, event and system state below is original synthetic teaching data. Work only on local files or an explicitly authorized isolated lab, without production access or other people’s data. One hundred synthetic events expose five tracked semantic fields each, giving 500 slots; twenty source values are unresolved. Known semantic completeness is (500−20)/500=96%; unresolved slots retain traceable reasons.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]}],"references":[{"id":"v27-case-ae875c4a049ea6a4","url":"https://pip.pypa.io/en/stable/topics/secure-installs/","title":"pip secure installs: hash-checking mode","titleEn":"pip secure installs: hash-checking mode","publisher":"Python Packaging Authority","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."},{"id":"v27-case-5b94367fee156667","url":"https://github.com/ocsf/ocsf-schema","title":"Open Cybersecurity Schema Framework","titleEn":"Open Cybersecurity Schema Framework","publisher":"OCSF","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"overview":"比較相鄰案例與另一組案例的模型、可量測結果及可轉移的驗證方法。","overviewEn":"Compare neighboring and cross-group cases by model, measurable outcome, and transferable verification method."}]},"places":{"courses":[]},"vendors":{"courses":[],"vendors":[]}}};
